                                "example_id": "1709448b-c1ec-4008-aea5-a30d26c58992",
                                "sense_id": "0c5125c8-2440-3c99-b8b0-a9c47537b9cb",
                                "text": "Television presenter and dog owner Ben Fogle, 36, says his relationship with his dog has brought countless happy memories and also led to him meeting his now-wife, Marina.",
